  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Freeze non‑essential immigration; offshore processing and detention/removal of illegal arrivals; 5‑year residency for benefits; higher employer NI for foreign workers; leave the ECHR; abandon the Windsor Framework; scrap retained EU law and prepare to renegotiate the TCA; British Bill of Rights and overhaul of equalities/free‑speech laws; restrict gender identity policies in schools and ensure single‑sex facilities; prioritise locals in social housing; recruit 40,000 police, expand stop and search, tougher sentences and more prisons; repeal ULEZ/low‑traffic schemes; scrap Net Zero and expand domestic oil/gas. TEXT_F: Legal annual cap on work/family migration that falls each year; higher salary thresholds, restrict dependants, monthly removals to Rwanda; tougher sentences, four new prisons, new protest controls including face‑covering bans; mandatory National Service at 18; defence to 2.5% of GDP; protect single‑sex accommodation and implement the Cass Review; deepen EU TCA without ceding sovereignty; extensive environmental/biodiversity measures, trebling offshore wind, no fracking.",
